-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기아자동차</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">주</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">와 한국사회복지협의회는 교통사고로 피해를 입은 세대의 유자녀에게 장학금을 통해 학업을 지원하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">본 사업 지원 대상에 해당되는 학생은 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">「</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교통사고 유자녀 장학금 지원사업</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">」 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신청 안내문</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">붙임</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 <font color=\"#0900ff\">필독</font>하셔서 기한까지 장학금 신청서류를 접수하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대 상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교통사고로 부</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">모 중 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">인 이상이 사망 혹은 중증후유장애를 입은 자의 유자녀 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">접수기한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2012. 12. 3(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 2013. 2. 4(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">우편 소인까지 유효</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">접수방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">더나눔</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.thenanum.net)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">및 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">복지넷</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.bokji.net)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">에서 신청서 다운로드</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;*</strong></span><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대학생은 반드시 학교를 통해서만 신청해야하므로</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">해당 학생은 신청 자료를 모두 구비하여</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>2013</strong></span><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0p